{title: I Have Decided To Follow Jesus}
{key: G}

{comment: Chorus 1}
I have de[G]cided to follow Jesus.
I have de[C]cided to follow Je[G]sus.
I have decided to follow Je[Em]sus.
No turning [G]back, [D]  no turning [G]back.

{comment: Chorus 2}
The world be[G]hind me, the cross before me
The world be[C]hind me, the cross be[G]fore me
The world be[G]hind me, the cross be[Em]fore me
No turning [G]back, [D]  no turning [G]back.

{comment: Chorus 3}
Though none go [G]with me, still I will follow.
Though none go [C]with me, still I will fol[G]low.
Though none go [G]with me, still I will fol[Em]low.
No turning [G]back, [D]  no turning [G]back.

{comment: Chorus 4}
Will you de[G]cide now to follow Jesus?
Will you de[C]cide now to follow Je[G]sus?
Will you de[G]cide now to follow Je[Em]sus?
No turning [G]back, [D]  no turning [G]back.
